agm: 1.0
package: infra.adr
version: 1.0.0
title: Infrastructure Architecture Decisions

node infra.decision.event_sourcing
type: decision
summary: adopt event sourcing for the order management domain to enable audit trails and replay
priority: high
stability: high
rationale:
  - full audit trail with immutable event log suits the compliance requirements
  - read models can be rebuilt from event history enabling temporal queries
  - natural fit for the async event-driven architecture already in place
tradeoffs:
  - eventual consistency between write side and read projections must be accepted
  - higher initial complexity and steeper learning curve for the team
  - schema evolution of events requires versioning discipline
